[en.IDEA_C02_HOTLINE_HOOVES_PROJECT_019_DONE]
Tension is All You Need: Concentration of Magic Under High-Pressure and Derivative Resource Storage Applications

[en.IDEA_C02_HOTLINE_HOOVES_PROJECT_019_DONE_desc]
Authors: Dr. Hooves, Mare, et al.
Abstract:
In the enchantingly arcane realm of Equestria, where friendship and magic reign supreme, the study of magical energy compression has become an intriguing subject of exploration. This paper delves into the perilous yet tantalizing domain of compressing magical forces to unprecedented levels, presenting it as a potential solution for the storage and utilization of this boundless resource...

[zh.IDEA_C02_HOTLINE_HOOVES_PROJECT_019_DONE]
只需要压力就够了——魔法的高压浓缩技术与衍生资源储存应用

[zh.IDEA_C02_HOTLINE_HOOVES_PROJECT_019_DONE_desc]
作者：蹄博士
摘要：
在小马利亚这片充满魔法和友谊的神秘领域中，魔法能量的浓缩研究成为了一个充满吸引力的课题。本文深入探讨了将魔法力量压缩到前所未有的水平的危险但诱惑的领域，将其作为储存和利用这种无穷资源的潜在解决方案...
